      "type": "grammar",
      "title": "有的……有的……: some … others …",
      "body": "To split a group into parts, put 有的 before each part: 有的 + what some do, 有的 + what others do. The group comes first, at the start of the sentence. You can say just 有的, or 有的人 when talking about people.",
